**Verdict:** `PASS` | `NEEDS_WORK` | `REJECT`
**Summary:** <Single concise paragraph stating the overall health, primary risk, and recommended action.>

### 2. Quality Scorecard Matrix
| Dimension | Rating (1-5) | Status | Notes |
| :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **Interface Depth & Seams** | X/5 | PASS/WARN/BLOCK | <One sentence explanation> |
| **Cognitive Load & Readability** | X/5 | PASS/WARN/BLOCK | <One sentence explanation> |
| **Error Resilience** | X/5 | PASS/WARN/BLOCK | <One sentence explanation> |
| **Maintainability & Hygiene** | X/5 | PASS/WARN/BLOCK | <One sentence explanation> |

